{"id":"a433d8f87b4f42f5","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-bounded-arithmetic.md","title":"Bounded Arithmetic","display":"df-bounded-arithmetic — Bounded Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-bounded-arithmetic","aliases":["92-df-bounded-arithmetic"],"display":"df-bounded-arithmetic — Bounded Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[92-df-weak-pa]]","[[92-df-formal-system]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","[[92-ax-generalization]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-bounded-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-bounded-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-arithmetic — Bounded Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea47eabc51d9439c\" href=\"?note=ea47eabc51d9439c\" title=\"92-df-weak-pa\">92-df-weak-pa</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"16613851c4bce386\" href=\"?note=16613851c4bce386\" title=\"92-ax-modus-ponens\">92-ax-modus-ponens</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"906680bfce5f44c0\" href=\"?note=906680bfce5f44c0\" title=\"92-ax-generalization\">92-ax-generalization</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0\">\\(I\\Delta_0\\)</span> (bounded arithmetic fragment, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ea47eabc51d9439c\" href=\"?note=ea47eabc51d9439c\" title=\"92-df-weak-pa\">92-df-weak-pa</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}\">\\(\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}\\)</span> (the fixed signature and Hilbert rules)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormalSys}\">\\(\\mathrm{FormalSys}\\)</span> (formal-system predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundArith}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundArith}_G\\)</span> (definition-target bounded-arithmetic system)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundArith}_G\\coloneqq\n(\\Sigma_G,I\\Delta_0,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathrm{BoundArith}_G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundArith}_G\\coloneqq\n(\\Sigma_G,I\\Delta_0,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathrm{BoundArith}_G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有界算术：只允许<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>归纳</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0\">\\(I\\Delta_0\\)</span>是公理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundArith}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundArith}_G\\)</span>才是配上签名与规则后的形式系统</li>\n<li>只归纳有界量词公式</li>\n<li>证明力比PA弱</li>\n<li>有界算术研究证明复杂度</li>\n<li>常见扩张<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0+\\exp\">\\(I\\Delta_0+\\exp\\)</span>还需在签名中加入指数函数符号或用相应定义性扩张，不能把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp\">\\(\\exp\\)</span>当成本书原签名已有的符号</li>\n<li>有界算术的证明论</li>\n<li>不完备性在有界算术中的形式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"